.idea
# Scratch tsconfigs used to typecheck a subset of files, plus TypeScript's
# incremental build caches. Both are machine-local: a .tsbuildinfo committed to
# the repo is a stale cache that every other checkout has to ignore anyway.
tsconfig.*check.json
*.tsbuildinfo

# Original full-resolution media (239MB images + 195MB video).
# The app serves optimised derivatives from public/img and public/vid instead.
# Keeping the originals out of git avoids permanently bloating history; keep a
# copy elsewhere if you want to re-crop or re-encode later.
/public/images/*
!/public/images/README.md
/public/videos/*
!/public/videos/README.md

.vercel
.env*
audit/
.playwright-mcp/
